<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak forex trade turnover $8.53 bln in Feb.</title>
<headline>Slovak forex trade turnover $8.53 bln in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreign exchange trading in Slovakia in February totalled $8.53 billion, after $8.63 billion in January, the National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> SLOVAK FOREX TRADING    FEBRUARY     JANUARY     DECEMBER</p>
<p>(in millions of dollars)</p>
<p>  overall		     8,533	  8,631	 7,307</p>
<p>  USD trading		 5,498	  4,919	 4,243</p>
<p>  DM trading		  2,655	  3,267	 2,627</p>
<p>  other currencies	    380	    445	   437</p>
<p>TRADING IN USD</p>
<p>  with NBS at fix	     144	    234	   193</p>
<p>  at Slovak banks	   3,488	  3,574	 2,961</p>
<p>  at foreign banks	  1,866	  1,111	 1,089</p>
<p>  total			 5,498	  4,919	 4,243</p>
<p>TRADING IN DM</p>
<p>  with NBS at fix	     172	    136	    95</p>
<p>  at Slovak banks	   1,876	  2,470	 1,924</p>
<p>  foreign banks		 607	    661	   608</p>
<p>  total			 2,655	  3,267	 2,627</p>
<p>TRADING IN OTHER CURRENCIES</p>
<p>  at Slovak banks	     285	    364	   317</p>
<p>  foreign banks		  95	     81	   120</p>
<p>  total			   380	    445	   437</p>
<p>TOTAL NUMBER OF USD TRADES</p>
<p>  with NBS at fix		28	     35	    23</p>
<p>  at Slovak banks	   1,193	  1,317	 1,023</p>
<p>  foreign banks		 462	    367	   309</p>
<p>  total			 1,683	  1,719	 1,355</p>
<p>TOTAL NUMBER OF DM TRADES</p>
<p>  with NBS at fix		33	     40	    21</p>
<p>  at Slovak banks	   1,115	  1,375	 1,094</p>
<p>  foreign banks		 330	    345	   295</p>
<p>  total			 1,478	  1,760	 1,410</p>
<p>TOTAL  NUMBER OF TADES IN OTHER CURRENCIES</p>
<p>  at Slovak banks	     215	    265	   243</p>
<p>  foreign banks		  83	     70	    69</p>
<p>  total			   298	    335	   312</p>
<p>Note: All dollar figures are rounded off. All columns measure to end of period.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
